    72	The Book 5 plan was reconciled to the closed edition Book 4 (`book-05-the-silver-standard/state/B4-RECONCILIATION-APPLIED.md`). Seven items carry defaults in force, and none blocks drafting:
    73	- **O1 Season names.** The series calendar is season-blind in Book 5: weather words only, and no month order (#35, #36.4).
