   517	- **Lane:** the trodden cord-lane runs west from the floor through the western stone; the six are on the wrong/eastern side of the floor from it (`manuscript/chapter-30.md:9-29,199-201`). M5's 160-to-60 count must be staged within that longer approximately 233-yard retreat (`MOVEMENT-005.md:24`).
