    22	
    23	Cael stood at the barn door and looked at it. He had counted those stones from three hundred yards, and knelt among them, and run past them with eight hounds on the white behind him. He had not thought to see them again in a barn, pale and small, with a hen walking between the seventh and the eighth.
    24	
