editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-64-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-65-Seln took that, and set it somewhere, and went on.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-66-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-67-"Where is it written?"
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-68-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md:69:"Two books. The old volume's full, and it's in my trunk under the bed, locked. The current one's Hesk's book, and it's in the satchel." Cael touched the strap across his chest. "Everything since Ardenmere is in one or the other, every notice word for word and every price beside it."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-70-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-71-"Under the bed," said Seln.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-72-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-37.md-73-"Locked."
